<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8' standalone='no'?>
<sexAction>
	<buttonPriority>-1</buttonPriority>
	<actionConditional><![CDATA[
		[#!npc.isPlayer() && !sex.isCharacterWantingToStopSex(npc)]
	]]></actionConditional>
	<type>START_ONGOING</type>
	<pace/>
	<endsSex><![CDATA[false]]></endsSex>
	<participantType>NORMAL</participantType>
	<priority><![CDATA[UNIQUE_MAX]]></priority>
	<arousalPerformer>THREE_NORMAL</arousalPerformer>
	<arousalTarget>TWO_LOW</arousalTarget>
	<associatedCorruption>ONE_VANILLA</associatedCorruption>
	<associatedFetishes>
		<performer>
			<fetish>FETISH_ORAL_RECEIVING</fetish>
		</performer>
		<target>
			<fetish>FETISH_ORAL_GIVING</fetish>
		</target>
	</associatedFetishes>
	<performingArea>PENETRATION_PENIS</performingArea>
	<targetedArea>ORIFICE_MOUTH</targetedArea>
	<applyStartEffects><![CDATA[
	]]></applyStartEffects>
	<applyEffects><![CDATA[
	]]></applyEffects>
	<applyEndEffects><![CDATA[
	]]></applyEndEffects>
	<areasCummedIn/>
	<areasCummedOn/>
	<title><![CDATA[重新口交]]></title>
	<tooltip><![CDATA[
		现在这么爽，怎么能停下来！
	]]></tooltip>
	<descriptions>
		<description>
			<descriptionConditional><![CDATA[
				[#sex.getNumberOfOrgasms(dale)==1]
			]]></descriptionConditional>
			<text><![CDATA[
				虽然戴尔起初不愿意口交，但现在他却渴望你为他口交。你[pc.lips+]不再包裹着他那又粗又黑的鸡巴时，他用他那平平的龟头顶着你的嘴，低声咕哝道，[dale.speechNoEffects(继续，[pc.name]……)]
				<br/><br/>
				你非常乐意，[pc.tongue+]在他颤动的滚烫阴茎上舔动，随后将其含入口中，继续为你的情人热情口交……
			]]></text>
		</description>
		<description>
			<descriptionConditional><![CDATA[
				[#sex.getNumberOfOrgasms(dale)!=1]
			]]></descriptionConditional>
			<text><![CDATA[
				戴尔完全忘记了最初的犹豫，当他感觉到你[pc.lips+]不再包裹着他粗大的阴茎时，他发出了失望的哼声。他用一只手抓住自己滚烫的肉棒，把平平的龟头对着你的嘴，咕哝道，[dale.speechNoEffects(别停，[pc.name]……)]
				<br/><br/>
				看到戴尔如此热情，你很高兴，迫不及待地给他雄味浓重的滚烫阴茎来了个湿吻，随后分开唇瓣，将他颤动的阴茎含入口中……
			]]></text>
		</description>
	</descriptions>
</sexAction>
